    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 79 Grian Ard is a well presented three-bedroom semi-detached residence extending to approximately 90 sq.m., ideally situated within the popular residential area of Ardnacassa on the outskirts of Longford Town. This attractive home offers bright, comfortable accommodation and is perfectly suited to first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a convenient family home close to all local amenities.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious living room, and a kitchen/dining area with direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a main family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front with a private driveway, while the enclosed rear garden provides a safe and secure outdoor space with the added benefit of side access.\n\nGrian Ard enjoys an excellent location in Ardnacassa, within close proximity to Longford Town and its wide range of shops, schools, restaurants, and recreational facilities. The property also offers easy access to the N4 national route, making it an ideal choice for commuters travelling to Dublin, Sligo, and surrounding areas.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a conveniently located home in a well-established residential development."
      },
